"""
COMMAND:
  pgw_stats
DESCRIPTION:
  Get PGW statistics.
ARGUMENTS:
  <id=1..250+>                                                                        - local identifier of PGW

  [display|clear]                                                            - determine type of action on statistics:
                                                                               display or clear
     default = display

  [type=set of the following ,-separated]                                             - Statistics type
    data_iface_counters - Counters for S5U GTP-U Endpoint Statistics or SGI interface
    traffic             - L3 Traffic Statistics
     default = all

  [dir=ul|dl|bi]                                                                      - direction
     default = bi

  [data_iface=set of the following ,-separated]                               - gets the statistics for specified data
                                                                                        interface
    s5u - S5-U interface
    sgi - SGI interface
     default = all

  [s5u_endpoint=a.a.a.a:p (:p), where a=0..255, p=0..65355 ]                - IP address and port of the S5-U endpoint.
                                                                              All S5-U endpoints if not specified

  [format=one of the following:]                                                      - format for output data
    detail_short  - print common information on each item
    detail_long   - print detailed information on each item
    summary_short - print total common information for all items
    summary_long  - print total detailed information for all items
     default = summary_long
"""
